From: bornaradusin <bornaradusin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 11:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 55/55] PC5: a directory listing that fails says which step
 refused it (Wine patch 0938)

A .NET game whose folder can't be listed reports only "invalid handle"
(Heroes of Might and Magic: Olden Era's Story_maps, still after 0936,
whose logging never ran). NtQueryDirectoryFile now logs an error naming
the directory, the step (no descriptor from the server, not a directory,
its names not read) and the status, so the game's log says where it
fails. A listing that works logs nothing.
